    'Bypassing an anti-brute-force rate limit' => 'Melewati pembatasan laju antibrute-force',
    'Limit overruns are a subtype of so-called "time-of-check to time-of-use" (TOCTOU) flaws. Later in this topic, we\'ll look at some examples of race condition vulnerabilities that don\'t fall into either of these categories.' => 'Limit overrun merupakan subtipe celah time-of-check to time-of-use (TOCTOU). Bagian selanjutnya membahas skenario lain di luar kategori ini.',
