    'For a technical insight into the underlying mechanics of the single-packet attack, and a more detailed look at the methodology, check out the accompanying whitepaper: [[A0]]Smashing the state machine: The true potential of web race conditions[[/A0]]' => 'Penjelasan mekanisme teknis single-packet attack tersedia di makalah [[A0]]Smashing the state machine: The true potential of web race conditions[[/A0]].',
    'Detecting and exploiting limit overrun race conditions with Turbo Intruder' => 'Mendeteksi dan mengeksploitasi limit overrun race condition dengan Turbo Intruder',
