    'In this scenario, sending two parallel password reset requests from the same session, but with two different usernames, could potentially cause the following collision:' => 'Jika dua permintaan untuk username berbeda dikirim paralel memakai satu sesi yang sama, urutannya bisa bertabrakan:',
    'Note the final state when all operations are complete:' => 'Perhatikan kondisi akhir sesi setelah kedua permintaan selesai tereksekusi:',
    "The session now contains the victim's user ID, but the valid reset token is sent to the attacker." => 'ID akun korban tertinggal di sesi, sementara token yang cocok ikut terkirim ke email penyerang.',
    'For this attack to work, the different operations performed by each process must occur in just the right order. It would likely require multiple attempts, or a bit of luck, to achieve the desired outcome.' => 'Karena membutuhkan urutan tumpang tindih yang spesifik antarsub-proses, serangan ini sering memerlukan beberapa kali percobaan.',
    'Email address confirmations, or any email-based operations, are generally a good target for single-endpoint race conditions. Emails are often sent in a background thread after the server issues the HTTP response to the client, making race conditions more likely.' => 'Fitur pengiriman atau konfirmasi email sangat rentan karena proses pengiriman email sering berjalan di thread latar belakang setelah respons HTTP terkirim.',

    // Session locking & Partial construction & Prevention
    'Session-based locking mechanisms' => 'Mekanisme penguncian berbasis sesi',
    "Some frameworks attempt to prevent accidental data corruption by using some form of request locking. For example, PHP's native session handler module only processes one request per session at a time." => 'Beberapa platform seperti modul sesi bawaan PHP menerapkan penguncian sesi sehingga hanya memproses satu permintaan pada satu waktu per cookie sesi.',
    "It's extremely important to spot this kind of behavior as it can otherwise mask trivially exploitable vulnerabilities. If you notice that all of your requests are being processed sequentially, try sending each of them using a different session token." => 'Jika seluruh permintaan paralel dieksekusi berurutan secara lambat, uji ulang dengan menggunakan cookie sesi yang berbeda di tiap permintaan.',
    'Partial construction race conditions' => 'Race condition konstruksi parsial objek',
    'Many applications create objects in multiple steps, which may introduce a temporary middle state in which the object is exploitable.' => 'Pembuatan entitas di basis data secara bertahap dapat meninggalkan celah singkat ketika objek sudah ada tetapi kolom keamanannya belum terisi.',
